# Shipped defaults. Same keys as default_bindings in a2_files/defs.c.
# Format: SLUG:key:alt:ctrl:leader
# Lines that are not five colon-separated fields are ignored.
# Alt+Shift+S is registered three times (SHOW_SYMBOLS, EXPAND_SNIPPET, SETTINGS).
# The dispatcher returns the first match, which is SHOW_SYMBOLS. Use :settings.
# Alt+$ is both MOVE_END_ALT and WIN_POS_4. MOVE_END_ALT wins.
# Alt+d is a leader, so DIR_NAVIGATOR (also Alt+d) does not run. Ctrl+G opens it.
